text The three of us: one adult, one child, and one boar, walk side by side.
text It's certainly a strange combination.
text Still... a boar, huh...
text It reminds me of someone...
text When we finally reach the kindergarten, the boar leaves us behind, and dashes inside.
text I can hear the cheerful voices of children playing coming from the other side of the wall.
text It seems the boar is quite the celebrity.
text @[Tomoya]
text Good morning.
text @[Tomoya]
text I am leaving her in your care.
text I hand Ushio over to the teacher.
